      {
        "id": 221542,
        "name": "robertmaxfreeman",
        "username": "robertmaxfreeman",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/robertmaxfreeman/{size}/2147_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-11-23T17:44:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Strangely enough, I'd say as long as the players aren't new to the game, Oblivaeon isn't top tier difficulty, like Iron Legacy or Dreamer, but closer to mid-tier, like La Capitan.</p>\n<p>The rule variants here are not to make him easier, but a faster&nbsp;and more enjoyable gaming experience.</p>",
